# The collected user records are versioned in compressed form under datasets/
# (14 MB, from 94 MB expanded); recreate the expanded copy with the command in
# datasets/README.md. The per-user activity characteristics and the detection
# output that feeds the user analysis are not versioned at all: they are
# regenerated by running the pipeline.
data/
data_row/
user_characteristics/

# Collector state, written at run time
module_states.json
checkpoint.json

# Local tooling
.idea/
__pycache__/
*.log
